  "name": "runpod-rs",
  "description": "A Rust-based SDK and command-line interface for the RunPod cloud GPU platform, facilitating automated management of GPU instances. It implements a type-safe GraphQL client to handle complex orchestration tasks such as pod spawning, spot instance bidding, and real-time resource monitoring. The repository is structured as a workspace to separate the core client logic from the user-facing CLI, providing a robust foundation for cloud-native GPU workflows.",
